    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d254-a6">

                <pb facs="0381" n="293" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg293"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sanchez to Mr.
                            Dawson.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Dominican Republic, Ministry of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1904-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August
                                12, 1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: Referring to the conversation
                    which I had with your excellency on the 5th instant and in which I showed you
                    the telegram that I had received from Macoris, I now have the honor to confirm
                    the same and to assert that Mr. Martinez was prosecuted for abuse of confidence;
                    but for the sake of complying with your excellency’s wishes, and in view of his
                    being sick, Mr. Martinez has been given his liberty under bond.</p>
                <p>They are using all diligence necessary to hasten the procedure as much as
                    possible, and, in the event of their not being able to discontinue the action,
                    to adjudge him the least possible punishment.</p>
                <p>Greeting, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Juan Francisco
                    Sanchez.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
